@startuml
!include ../../common/style.puml
title process_inference_stream() — streaming with hold-back DLP
participant "Consumer" as C
participant "BaseLLMAgentService" as L
participant "Provider stream\n_dispatch_upstream_stream" as U
C -> L : async for chunk in process_inference_stream(...)
L -> L : same admission: sanitise, context budget,\npermit (held for the whole stream), quota
L -> U : open stream
loop each provider chunk
  U --> L : chunk
  L -> L : buf = redact(buf + chunk)\nrelease all but the last dlp_holdback_chars
  L --> C : safe prefix
  L -> L : deadline expired? → DeadlineExceeded
end
L -> L : redact and flush remaining buffer
L --> C : tail
L -> L : finally: settle quota (≈ chars/4 used),\nlog llm_stream_complete, release permit
note over L : failure → failed_keys + _handle_error, then RE-RAISED\n(no payload exists to carry a FAILED status)
@enduml
